          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yahova Nyasaye winyu aladiviza zihiiri ziosi lwa mwingiliraa kivala chavo, kandi mulakivugula no komenya mucho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wa Yahova kudiviza zihiiri yizio imbiri winyu, mulole ndi muvuli kolonda miima ji zidiini ziavo, kigira yivu vulava vuhimwa. Mutageriza kwenyeleriza kumanya kuli vasigamira avanyasaye vaavo, kunangwa musigamiri munzira ndala nzere mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutasigamira Yahova Nyasaye winyu kuli yavo vasigamira avanyasaye vaavo mba, kigira mu lisigamira avanyasaye vaavo, vakora vindu viukuvihiliriza zing'ano ziosi via Yahova adunyiraa. Kali vahaana avana vaavo kuli visiuviliru mu muliru ku vwali vwavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
